index 0000000..039f617
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69900.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Added `minimum`/`maximum` threshold configuration to the `diskusage` beacon, so it can alert
+when a mount's usage drops unexpectedly low (for example, a filesystem that failed to mount)
+in addition to the existing high-usage alerting. Existing plain-percentage configuration is
+unaffected and continues to behave exactly as before.
